					},
					"description": "Public. `otp` is the single-use code from Forgot Password (6 digits, 5-min TTL). On success the password is re-hashed, every active session is revoked and a confirmation email is sent. Errors: 400 invalid/expired OTP, 403 Google-only account.",
					"response": []
				},
